Khan Japanese — licensing
=========================

This repository holds two kinds of material under two different licences.
Which one applies depends on the file, so both are set out in full below.

Per-source attribution for the data, photography and music is on the site
itself, at credits.html.


-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Source code — MIT
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Applies to everything in this repository EXCEPT the three data files named in
section 2: all HTML, CSS and JavaScript, including the SQL schema.

